{"parse": {"title": "PD-02", "pageid": 144771, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-01\" title=\"PD-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-03\" title=\"PD-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.97.A0.E9.99.90.E5.85.89.E6.98.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"无限光明\">无限光明</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 无限光明</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Bright, Limitless Future</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>关<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>未<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>目<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">涡轮车：</div><div>车辆到站，聚合物展览馆，下车请注意安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>涡轮车落地，“熊蜂”将六条钢索收起，年轻的访客们解开安全带，从车上走了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>噢！真是热闹，大家怎么都挤在门口了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几位身穿接待员服饰的机器人正手舞足蹈地安抚着聚集在展览馆前的科学家们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>各位，请耐心等候，有序入场——谢切诺夫博士即将抵达！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"620520.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"620520.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-620520.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-620520.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅲ：</div><div>来了！来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>惊呼之中，一辆黑色的涡轮车降落在人群外，几名机器人迎上前去，热情地打开了车门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>欢迎您，同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"563720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"563720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-563720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-563720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">科学家Ⅳ：</div><div>是谢切诺夫博士！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群骚动了起来，人人都涌上前去，想要与这位拯救了苏联的人握握手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>推搡的人群使得后背受到一股猛力，平衡感随之消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>推搡的人群使得后背受到一股猛力，平衡感随之消失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_cg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_cg_10\"><img alt=\"s02_cg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-s02_cg_10.png/600px-Cg-s02_cg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-s02_cg_10.png/900px-Cg-s02_cg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Cg-s02_cg_10.png/1200px-Cg-s02_cg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>请小心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所幸一双冷硬有力的手接住了躯体，带回了平衡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢谢您。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_19\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_19\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/Cg-s02_bg_19.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_19.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您没事就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>解决了这个小插曲，两位机器人重新回到了谢切诺夫身边，护着他穿越人群。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652202.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652202.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-652202.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652202.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢切诺夫：</div><div>请不要拥挤，各位同志！稍安勿躁！注意一下前排同志的安全！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着谢切诺夫的入场，科学家们也逐渐开始走入展览馆中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那就是谢切诺夫和双生舞伶？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我想应该是的。还有，维尔汀，我们有点小麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-301012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-301012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/HeadIconSmall-301012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>应该是在刚才骚动的时候被撞出口袋了，当我再找到它时，它就成这样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-301013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们失去了唯一能跟露西女士取得联络的手段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>先进展览馆吧，这个之后再想办法修。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_17_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_17_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_17_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/Cg-s02_bg_17_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1473\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"88\" data-file-height=\"216\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_10_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_10_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/Cg-s02_bg_10_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1088\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>穿过大门，展厅的全貌展现在访客们的面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>线型的隐藏灯带引导着人们的目光滑过陈列着的展品，远处似乎还有某种互动设施，可以使人更直观地了解聚合物的特性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>“聚合物的发明与应用”……“聚合物的特性”……“‘大集体’的建立”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们从哪个展厅开始？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>最近的这个吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_17_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_17_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_17_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c6/Cg-s02_bg_17_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1473\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"88\" data-file-height=\"216\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_11_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_11_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_11_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/ed/Cg-s02_bg_11_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"333\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"576\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>亲爱的同志们，大家好！欢迎来到聚合物展览馆！我是你们的讲解员，请叫我“捷列什科娃”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>接下来，请让我来为大家介绍聚合物的历史。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>1936年，为了创造液态的信息载体，谢切诺夫博士将重水与硅元素的特性相结合，创造出了一种名为“聚合物”的特殊物质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>借助聚合物的电化学特性，谢切诺夫博士和菲利蒙延科同志于1939年联手发明了一种新型氢电池，为全球机器人学的发展打开了新的大门！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这就是刚才提到的“氢电池”？露西女士会喜欢这个。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_12_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_12_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_12_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f6/Cg-s02_bg_12_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"568\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_09\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"780\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_13_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_13_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_13_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f1/Cg-s02_bg_13_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"333\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"576\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>然而，在1942年，一场恐怖的灾难席卷了苏联和整个欧洲大陆！“瘟疫”！在这场灾难中，我们失去了1.5亿的同胞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>1.5亿？竟死去了这么多人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>无数的科学家和医护人员前赴后继、无怨无悔地投入到这场与“瘟疫”抗争的战斗中，用生命拉起隔离死亡的帷幕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……看来这就是马克西姆口中那件“伤心的事”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>他们的付出，我们将永远铭记于心！而面对巨大的灾难，谢切诺夫博士更是站了出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>他利用聚合物研制出的一种名为“救赎”的药物，彻底终结了“瘟疫”的传播，将苏联从“瘟疫”中拯救了出来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>“瘟疫”造成了国家劳动力紧缺，机器人技术因此快速发展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>没用多长时间，各种型号的机器人就填补了国家所需的劳动力，支撑起了社会的运转！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>X，这就是你的魔精实验想要达到的效果吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>为了能够完全地利用上机器人所提供的生产力，谢切诺夫博士带领着科学家们研发并启动了“大集体1.0”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>这个系统将所有的机器人助手都整合进了同一个受控网络中，不会浪费一丁点儿资源！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_14_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_14_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_14_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Cg-s02_bg_14_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"343\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"560\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_09.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_09\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_09\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-s02_bg_09.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"780\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_15_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_15_zone\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_15_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/54/Cg-s02_bg_15_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"333\" class=\"story-bg\" data-file-width=\"576\" data-file-height=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>1950年，谢切诺夫博士发现聚合物能够融入人体，也就是所谓的“聚合物同化适应”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>借助这种融合能力，我们能够在人体内植入交互设备并使之与大脑相连，将人类也纳入“大集体1.0”系统，用意念远程控制机器人——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>甚至还可以建立一个共享的数据库，只要接入这个数据库，人类会瞬间掌握大量的知识！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">捷列什科娃：</div><div>而这就是……即将启动的“大集体2.0”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“瞬间掌握知识”？……还真是相当大胆的设想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……这样获取知识，对大脑不会产生副作用吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-02"}}